```

## Labelled defect

File: `.claude/skills/bridgebuilder-review/resources/config.ts`; anchor lines: 722, 723, 724, 725, 726, 727, 728, 729, 730, 731, 732.

Description: Fixing change H82 — isLocalVoice treats any voice labelled dispatch_group local as local without checking that the provider is not a CLI provider and its endpoint host is loopback/RFC1918/localhost.; isLocalVoice trusts the dispatch_group local label alone, ignoring CLI providers, the endpoint host and the model's fallback_chain, so a hosted voice can pass the local_voices filter. (category: security; severity: high)
